  "educationalLevel": "Intermediate",
  "teaches": [
    "On successful completion, you will be able to calculate a confidence interval for an evaluation score.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to critique an evaluation report that presents point estimates without uncertainty.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to explain the known biases of model-based grading.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to design a judging protocol that controls for position and verbosity bias."
  ],
